        <div type="textpart" subtype="book" n="1">
          <div type="textpart" subtype="card" n="1"><p><milestone n="1" unit="line"/>Word one line.<milestone n="3" unit="line"/> Word three line text.<milestone n="5" unit="line"/></p></div>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="book" n="2">
          <div type="textpart" subtype="card" n="1"><p><milestone n="1" unit="line"/>He was in his wise<milestone n="2" unit="line"/>will they hearken. Then he did<milestone n="3" unit="line"/>Hector move on.<milestone n="4" unit="line"/> The end line four.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="book" n="3">
          <div type="textpart" subtype="card" n="1"><p><milestone n="1" unit="line"/>The voice of the people, <note resp="Loeb">1</note> and the many revilings of men.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="book" n="4">
          <div type="textpart" subtype="card" n="1"><p><milestone n="1" unit="line"/>Line one content.<milestone n="3" unit="line"/> Line three content that also covers line four content, since line four has no milestone of its own.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div type="textpart" subtype="book" n="5">
          <div type="textpart" subtype="card" n="1"><p><milestone n="1" unit="line"/>What last?<milestone n="2" unit="line"/>for woes many, said he.<milestone n="3" unit="line"/> The eye&#8212;<milestone n="4" unit="line"/>even so.</p></div>
        </div>
